This package includes a derived snapshot of the schema.org vocabulary in
src/data/schema-org-vocabulary.json (and its compiled copy under dist/).
schema.org vocabulary data is published by Schema.org under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 license (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://schema.org/docs/terms.html
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

The snapshot keeps the type hierarchy, property domains and ranges,
enumeration members, superseded, pending and retired terms of the release it
names. It is generated by scripts/build-schema-vocabulary.mjs and may be
shared and adapted under the same CC BY-SA 3.0 terms.
